      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi mlavyadzi-sadaka, Pashihuri, mwana wa Imeri, ariyekala ofisaa mkpwulu kpwenye nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, wamsikira Jeremia analavya unabii uho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Pashihuri achimpiga nabii Jeremia chisha achimfunga magogolo phatu phokala ryango ra dzulu ra Benjamini kahi ya yo nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuriphocha achimrichira kula chifungoni, naye Jeremia achimuamba, “Mwenyezi Mlungu kandakuiha tsona Pashihuri, ela Tisho ra pande zosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba, ‘Lola, ndakuhenda udziogofyere we mwenye na uogofyere asenao osi. Asenao andaolagbwa na upanga ni maadui aho kuno unalola. Chisha ndatiya atu a Juda mikononi mwa mtawala wa Babeli. Iye andaahala mateka aaphirike Babeli ambako andaaolaga anjina kpwa upanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zaidi ya gago, ndalavya utajiri wa nyo mudzi, mapato gosi, vitu vyosi vya samani na akiba zosi za afalume a Juda kpwa maadui gao ndiovihala aphiye navyo Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe uwe Pashihuri na osi asagalao mwako nyumbani mundahalwa mateka mphirikpwe Babeli. Kuko undafwa na uzikpwe phamwenga na asenao uriolavya nao unabii wa handzo.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
